exports[`Témoins · pendant la bêta (12/10/2026) > Tarifs (FR, EN ; anonyme, gratuit, Pro ; venu de l'éditeur) > tarifs bêta en anonyme 1`] = `"<div class="animate-rise mx-auto max-w-4xl py-4 sm:py-8" data-tarifs-beta=""><header class="text-center"><p class="eyebrow">Free beta</p><h1 class="mt-2 text-[30px] font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">All of AVYORA is free through December 31, 2026</h1><p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-xl text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted">All you need is an account. No payment method is required, and nothing will ever be charged automatically: not during the beta, not after.</p></header><div class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-md text-center"><a class="btn btn-primary w-full justify-center py-3 text-[15px]" href="/inscription?source=tarifs">Create my free account</a><p class="mt-3 text-[13px] text-muted">Already have an account? <a class="font-medium text-brand-600 hover:underline" href="/connexion">Sign in</a></p></div><div class="mt-6 overflow-hidden rounded-panel bg-gradient-to-r from-[#4F46E5] via-[#6d5cf0] to-[#7C3AED] px-6 py-5 text-center text-white shadow-card" data-tarifs-fondateur=""><div class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-indigo-100/90">Founding members</div><div class="mt-1 text-[20px] font-semibold tracking-tight">A preferred rate guaranteed for life, announced before the beta ends</div><div class="mt-1 text-[13.5px] text-indigo-100/85">Create your account during the beta: you become a founding member.</div><div class="mx-auto mt-2 max-w-xl text-[12.5px] text-indigo-100/75">Nothing will be charged: once AVYORA becomes paid, you subscribe only if you want to.</div></div><div class="mx-auto mt-8 grid max-w-3xl gap-6 rounded-panel border border-line bg-surface p-6 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_240px] sm:items-start sm:gap-8"><div><div class="eyebrow mb-3">Included during the beta</div><ul class="space-y-2.5"><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-ink"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-brand-600" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>Detailed estimator — all 200 items, line by line</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-ink"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-brand-600" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>DIY vs. hire-out choice on every task</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-ink"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-brand-600" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>PDF report export (bank, contractors)</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-ink"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-brand-600" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>Save all your projects</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-ink"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-brand-600" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>Project tracking, line by line</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-ink"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-brand-600" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>New build: your house detailed phase by phase, from permit to completion</li></ul></div><figure class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[240px]"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="/exemple-rapport-760.webp 760w, /exemple-rapport-1040.webp 1040w" sizes="240px"/><img src="/exemple-rapport.png" alt="Example of a detailed AVYORA estimate report" width="1040" height="1458" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="w-full rounded-field border border-line shadow-card"/></picture><figcaption class="mt-2.5 text-center text-[11px] leading-snug text-faint">Example of a detailed report — 145 m² house in Bordeaux.</figcaption></figure></div><p class="mt-6 text-center text-[13px] text-muted">Already have an account? <a class="font-medium text-brand-600 hover:underline" href="/connexion">Sign in</a>. Or <a class="font-medium text-brand-600 hover:underline" href="/projets/nouveau">continue with the free quick estimate</a>.</p></div>"`;

