@media (pointer:coarse){.av-choix .changer{min-height:44px;padding:0 16px}}

.av-choix .plan-band{margin-top:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;background:var(--color-surface);border:1px dashed var(--color-brand-200);border-radius:16px;padding:16px 18px}
.av-choix .plan-ico{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none;background:var(--color-brand-50);color:var(--color-brand-600)}
.av-choix .plan-txt{flex:1;min-width:0}
.av-choix .plan-titre{margin:0;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-ink);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.av-choix .plan-d{margin:3px 0 0;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--color-muted);line-height:1.5}
.av-choix .plan-partir{margin:4px 0 0;min-height:1.25rem;font-size:13.5px}
.av-choix .plan-partir .lien{color:var(--color-brand-600);font-weight:500;text-decoration:none}
.av-choix .plan-partir .lien:hover{text-decoration:underline}
.av-choix .plan-band .plan-go{width:auto;flex:none;white-space:nowrap}
@media (max-width:720px){.av-choix .plan-band{flex-wrap:wrap}.av-choix .plan-ico{display:none}.av-choix .plan-band .plan-go{width:100%}}
.av-choix .plan-tel{display:none;margin:4px 0 0;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--color-faint)}
@media (max-width:600px){.av-choix .plan-tel{display:block}}
</style><header class="animate-rise"><div class="sur"><p class="eyebrow">Nouvelle estimation · Construction neuve</p><a class="changer" aria-label="Changer de type de projet" href="/projets/nouveau">Changer</a></div><h1 class="ttl">Comment veux-tu estimer ta maison ?</h1><p class="sub">Ta maison, du permis de construire à la remise des clés. Commence rapide, affine quand tu veux — sans rien ressaisir.</p></header><div class="grid"><section class="ch-card"><div class="row1"><span class="ico free" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M13 2 4 14h6l-1 8 9-12h-6l1-8Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span class="tag gratis">Gratuit</span></div><h2>Estimation rapide</h2><p class="lead">5 questions, un budget tout compris immédiat. Idéal pour un premier ordre de grandeur.</p><ul><li><svg class="ck-free" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span>Surface, plain-pied ou étage, code postal du terrain</span></li><li><svg class="ck-free" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span>Études, taxes, construction et branchements compris</span></li><li><svg class="ck-free" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span>Sans inscription, résultat instantané</span></li></ul><div class="spacer"></div><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/estimation-construction-maison">Commencer gratuitement →</a><p class="foot">Aucune carte requise</p></section><section class="ch-card pro"><div class="row1"><span class="ico pro" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 7h10M4 12h16M4 17h7"