.av-choix .plan-band{margin-top:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;background:var(--color-surface);border:1px dashed var(--color-brand-200);border-radius:16px;padding:16px 18px}
.av-choix .plan-ico{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none;background:var(--color-brand-50);color:var(--color-brand-600)}
.av-choix .plan-txt{flex:1;min-width:0}
.av-choix .plan-titre{margin:0;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-ink);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.av-choix .plan-d{margin:3px 0 0;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--color-muted);line-height:1.5}
.av-choix .plan-partir{margin:4px 0 0;min-height:1.25rem;font-size:13.5px}
.av-choix .plan-partir .lien{color:var(--color-brand-600);font-weight:500;text-decoration:none}
.av-choix .plan-partir .lien:hover{text-decoration:underline}
.av-choix .plan-band .plan-go{width:auto;flex:none;white-space:nowrap}
@media (max-width:720px){.av-choix .plan-band{flex-wrap:wrap}.av-choix .plan-ico{display:none}.av-choix .plan-band .plan-go{width:100%}}
.av-choix .plan-tel{display:none;margin:4px 0 0;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--color-faint)}
@media (max-width:600px){.av-choix .plan-tel{display:block}}
</style><header class="animate-rise"><div class="sur"><p class="eyebrow">Nouvelle estimation · Rénovation</p><a class="changer" aria-label="Changer de type de projet" href="/projets/nouveau">Changer</a></div><h1 class="ttl">Comment veux-tu estimer ?</h1><p class="sub">Deux façons d&#x27;obtenir ton budget travaux. Commence rapide, affine quand tu veux — sans rien ressaisir.</p></header><div class="grid"><section class="ch-card"><div class="row1"><span class="ico free" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M13 2 4 14h6l-1 8 9-12h-6l1-8Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span class="tag gratis">Gratuit</span></div><h2>Estimation rapide</h2><p class="lead">4 questions, une fourchette chiffrée immédiate. Idéal pour un premier ordre de grandeur.</p><ul><li><svg class="ck-free" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span>Type de bien, surface, ampleur — en 3 min</span></li><li><svg class="ck-free" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span>Fourchette ±15 % adaptée à ton code postal</span></li><li><svg class="ck-free" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span>Sans inscription, résultat instantané</span></li></ul><div class="spacer"></div><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/estimation-travaux">Commencer gratuitement →</a><p class="foot">Aucune carte requise</p></section><section class="ch-card pro"><div class="row1"><span class="ico pro" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 7h10M4 12h16M4 17h7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path><circle cx="17.5" cy="7" r="2.2" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="13.5" cy="17" r="2.2" fill="currentColor"></circle></svg></span><span class="tag propill" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M8 1l2 4 4 .5-3 3 .8 4.3L8 11l-3.8 1.8L5 8.5 2 5.5 6 5l2-4Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg>Bêta</span></div><h2>Estimation détaillée</h2><p class="lead">Ajuste chaque poste et obtiens une estimation précise, prête à comparer aux devis des artisans.</p><ul><li><svg class="ck-pro" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span>Poste par poste, quantités ajustables en direct</span></li><li><svg class="ck-pro" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span>Rapport PDF détaillé — qui fait quoi, budget par corps d&#x27;état</span></li><li><svg class="ck-pro" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span>Suivi de chantier et modifications illimitées</span></li></ul><div class="spacer"></div><a class="btn btn-pro" href="/inscription?next=%2Fprojets%2Fnouveau%2Fdetaille%3Fnew%3D1&amp;source=choix-reno">Créer mon compte gratuit →</a><p class="foot"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M8 1l2 4 4 .5-3 3 .8 4.3L8 11l-3.8 1.8L5 8.5 2 5.5 6 5l2-4Z" fill="var(--color-accent-500)"></path></svg>Gratuit pendant la bêta, il suffit d&#x27;un compte.</p></section></div><aside class="plan-band" aria-label="Partir de mon plan"><span class="plan-ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M2.5 7.2 8 2.6l5.5 4.6V13a.8.8 0 0 1-.8.8H3.3a.8.8 0 0 1-.8-.8V7.2Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6.3 13.8V9.6h3.4v4.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><div class="plan-txt"><p class="plan-titre">Partir de mon plan<span class="tag propill">Bêta</span></p><p class="plan-d">Pars de ton logement tel qu&#x27;il est : dessine-le, décide tes travaux, le budget suit chaque décision.</p></div><a href="/inscription?next=%2Fplan%3Ftype%3Drenovation&amp;source=choix-plan" class="btn btn-outline plan-go">Créer mon compte gratuit →</a></aside><div class="hint"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"></circle><path d="M10 9v5M10 6.2v.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg><span>Pas sûr ? Commence par l&#x27;<b>estimation rapide</b> — tu pourras passer en détaillée à tout moment, tes réponses sont conservées.</span></div></div>"
